# Each tab says its PR's state in one word: a conflict outranks the rest of an open PR's state,
# then draft, then the review decision, else Open.
wait settled
open tamarinworks/bedrock#2193
open tamarinworks/gazette#272
open tamarinworks/gazette#273
open tamarinworks/atrium#2928
open tamarinworks/porter#1522
wait settled
expect text "Open" in #pr-tab 1
expect text "Approved" in #pr-tab 2
expect text "Draft" in #pr-tab 3
expect text "Conflicts" in #pr-tab 4
expect text "Merged" in #pr-tab 5
appearance dark
snap tab-status-dark
appearance light
snap tab-status-light
